  "details": "I have an asset called Gumboy from Gumboisland on gumroad. Normally this asset works perfectly fine with zero problems, however if I equip any accessory to my avatar then mirrors will show the object suddenly in my head when it should be invisible. Turning the object on, makes it disappear from the mirror instead. Same goes for cameras. I don't really understand how or why an accessory would interfere with something that does not have this problem on its own. Until it is fixed, I cannot use accessories effectively. I've never gotten to use them at this point as before trying today, my last attempt with this system showed my model infinitely far away so that editing it became impossible. I hope you guys manage to resolve this. Also make sure you drink water and eat breakfast, it's important to focus on your health!",
